graph LR
    TAO["TrustyAI Service Operator<br/>+ trustyai-operator-module"]

    %% Platform orchestration
    RHODS["rhods-operator"] -->|TrustyAI component CR| TAO

    %% Internal RHOAI integrations
    TAO -->|InferenceService logger patch| KServe["KServe InferenceService"]
    TAO -->|MM_PAYLOAD_PROCESSORS patch| ModelMesh["ModelMesh"]
    TAO -->|EvalHub experiments| MLflow["MLflow<br/>mlflow.kubeflow.org"]
    TAO -->|EvalHub job profiles| HWP["HardwareProfile<br/>infrastructure.opendatahub.io"]
    TAO -->|auth sidecar image| KRP["odh-kube-rbac-proxy"]
    TAO -->|LMES job image| LMEH["lm-evaluation-harness<br/>opendatahub-io fork"]
    TAO -->|CA bundles| CABundle["odh-trusted-ca-bundle<br/>openshift-service-ca.crt"]
    TAO -.->|MCP-guardrails mode| Kuadrant["Kuadrant MCP Gateway"]
    Dashboard["ODH Dashboard<br/>eval-hub-ui"] -->|HTTPS 8443 EvalHub API| TAO
    KServePred["KServe predictors"] -->|payloads 4443 / 8080| TAO

    %% External runtime dependencies
    TAO -->|API server 6443| K8s["Kubernetes API"]
    TAO -->|Routes, service-ca, TLS profile| OCP["OpenShift<br/>Router / service-ca / APIServer config"]
    TAO -->|ServiceMonitors<br/>module precondition| Prom["Prometheus"]
    TAO -.->|optional, Raw mode| Istio["Istio"]
    TAO -.->|optional, failure reporting| Kueue["Kueue"]
    TAO -.->|optional storage| PG["PostgreSQL"]
    TAO -.->|optional OTLP| OTEL["OpenTelemetry Collector"]

    %% Build / library dependencies
    TAO -->|framework| CR["controller-runtime v0.23.3"]
    TAO -->|clients| ClientGo["client-go / api v0.35.x"]
    TAO -->|types| KServeLib["kserve v0.19.0"]
    TAO -->|types| KueueLib["kueue v0.16.0-devel"]
    TAO -->|Route / APIServer / TLS| OSLib["openshift api / library-go"]
    TAO -->|ServiceMonitor types| PromOp["prometheus-operator v0.74.0"]
    TAO -->|module rendering| ODHUtil["odh-platform-utilities"]
    TAO -->|metrics| PromClient["prometheus client_golang v1.24.1"]
    TAO -.->|opt-in| OTELLib["otel v1.45.0"]
    TAO -->|build| Go["Go 1.26<br/>strictfipsruntime"]

